	-- Step 5: Into the Valley of Bones
	-- {area:608} Nijel's Point · {area:405} Desolace · {area:604} Magram Village · {area:2657} Valley of Bones · {area:16651} Shen'dralas
	["Ride south from {area:608} down the road through eastern {area:405} to {area:604}: just past its western edge the path climbs into the {area:2657} and {area:16651}."] = "{area:608} karakolundan doğu {area:405} içinden geçen yolu güneye, {area:604} köyüne in: batı kenarının hemen ötesinde patika {area:2657} ve {area:16651} içine tırmanır.",

	-- Step 6: The Valley of Bones: a Tattered Journal
	-- {area:2657} Valley of Bones · {quest:93644} Tattered Journal
	["The {area:2657}: a {quest:93644}"] = "{area:2657}: bir {quest:93644}",
	-- {quest:93644} Tattered Journal · {zone:2652} Shen'dralas · {area:2657} Valley of Bones
	-- plural, as words: Outcast Necromancers = {npc:11559} Outcast Necromancer · Magram Necromancers = {npc:253272} Magram Necromancer
	-- was: ["New in Forever: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.\nThe Outcast Necromancers and the Magram Necromancers of the valley drop a {quest:93644} whose writer lives in {zone:2652}: players got it within a few kills. The Magram centaurs leave you be until you attack; the Magram Necrokhans among them (level 45) are elites: leave them be.\nThe Gelkis and Magram centaurs have {area:2657} quest chains of their own, worth about 20,000 to 30,000 more experience, but each chain asks for Honored with its clan. The two clans are rivals, so work for one of them: the Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation guide, under Reputation, shows how."] = "Neu in Forever: Wenn ein Schritt falsch ist, sag uns auf Polestars Discord oder GitHub Bescheid und nenne den Schritt.\nDie Ausgestoßenen Totenbeschwörer und die Totenbeschwörer der Magram im Tal droppen {quest:93644}, dessen Verfasser in {zone:2652} lebt: Spieler bekamen es nach wenigen Kills. Die Magram-Zentauren lassen dich in Ruhe, bis du angreifst; die Nekrokhane der Magram darunter (Stufe 45) sind Elite: Lass sie in Ruhe.\nDie Gelkis- und Magram-Zentauren haben eigene Questreihen in {area:2657}, etwa 20.000 bis 30.000 Erfahrung mehr wert, aber jede Reihe verlangt Wohlwollend beim jeweiligen Clan. Die beiden Clans sind Rivalen, also arbeite für einen davon: Der Guide zum Ruf bei den Gelkis- und Magram-Zentauren unter Ruf zeigt, wie."
	["New in Forever: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.\nThe Outcast Necromancers and the Magram Necromancers of the valley drop a {quest:93644} whose writer lives in {zone:2652}: players got it within a few kills. Take it from the Outcast Necromancers and leave the Magram alone: the Magram centaurs leave you be until you attack, but once you have killed Magram the whole clan turns on you, and their Necrokhans (level 45, elites) stand around the western pylon you repair later.\nThe Gelkis and Magram centaurs have {area:2657} quest chains of their own, worth about 20,000 to 30,000 more experience, but each chain asks for Honored with its clan. The two clans are rivals, so work for one of them: the Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation guide, under Reputation, shows how."] = "Forever'da yeni: bir adım yanlışsa Polestar'ın Discord'unda ya da GitHub'ında adımı belirterek bize bildir.\nVadinin Outcast Necromancer ve Magram Necromancer yaratıkları, yazarı {zone:2652} bölgesinde yaşayan bir {quest:93644} düşürür: oyuncular onu birkaç öldürmede aldı. Onu Outcast Necromancer'lardan al, Magram'lara dokunma: Magram centaur'ları sen saldırana kadar sana bulaşmaz, ama bir Magram öldürdüğün anda bütün klan sana döner. Necrokhan'ları da (45. seviye, elit) daha sonra onaracağın batı pylon'unun çevresinde duruyor.\nGelkis ve Magram centaur'larının kendi {area:2657} görev zincirleri var, yaklaşık 20.000-30.000 ek deneyim değerinde, ama her zincir kendi klanıyla Honored ister. İki klan rakip, yani birinin için çalış: Reputation altındaki Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation rehberi nasıl yapılacağını gösterir.",

	-- Step 7: The western pylon
